signoff[review-usability] PASS df9e859 carried the independent PASS at 8bbdc00, which ran the binary cold from `--help` through sixteen states including a fresh machine with no manifest, a drifted and a missing vendored entry, and four malformed `stores.yml` shapes; its one claim against the README was checked and did not hold, because the formula installs `almanac` and symlinks `lmnc` to it, so both names do install together on the Homebrew path; minor: a misspelled top-level key in `stores.yml` is accepted silently, so `list` and `index` return a partial set
